*-----------------------------------------------------------------------
* PROCEDURE CLE 2000 CONCENTRATIONS ISOTOPES COMMANDE                  *
*-----------------------------------------------------------------------

* Procedure appelee par :
* 
* N_Pb_co N_B10_co_1 N_B10_co_2 N_B11_co_1 N_B11_co_2 N_Fe54_Eco
